Respond with a JSON object:
- `decision`: one of `"approve"`, `"modify"`, `"abort"` (this drives the branching map).
- `approved_works`: when approving, the subset of works to include in the corpus (array of work identifiers or objects); empty when modifying or aborting.
- `convergence_metric`: a 0.0–1.0 confidence in the decision (1.0 = high confidence the corpus is complete and correct).